        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ron Perkins, Christopher Nolan, Jonathan Nolan, Christopher Priest, Hugh Jackman\n- Works: The Prestige, House\n- Roles: American actor, hotel manager, Dr. Ron Simpson\n- Topics: film adaptation, television appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Ron Perkins is an American actor who has been active since the early 1960s.\n- The Prestige is a 2006 British-American mystery thriller film directed by Christopher Nolan.\n- The Prestige was adapted by Christopher Nolan and Jonathan Nolan from Christopher Priest's 1995 novel of the same name.\n- In 2006, Ron Perkins appeared in The Prestige as the manager of a hotel visited by Hugh Jackman's character in Colorado Springs.\n- Ron Perkins also appeared in nine episodes of the Fox television series House as Dr. Ron Simpson.",
